  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Efficient Agricultural Water Use and Management Enhancement in Paddy Fields</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase knowledge on the status of water use efficiency and productivity in paddy field systems and identification of best practices in the target countries, thus assisting the governments in determining how to improve the efficiency and effectiveness of future investments strategies and policies aiming at improving the productivity and sustainability of paddy fields.</narrative>
  </description>
